[Comments]
Lines=4
Line1=CiA 404-1 base analog input channel, INTEGER32 representation.
Line2=Pressure is reported in pascals at 0x9130sub1.
Line3=Depth is a manufacturer-specific UNSIGNED32 value at 0x2000.
Line4=TPDO1 payload is pressurePa followed by depthMm, both little-endian.

